  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Naturskyddsf&#xf6;r 2010-2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSNC South 2010-2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forts&#xe4;ttning de ett tre &#xe5;rigt ramavtal med Naturskyddsf&#xf6;reningen      under perioden 2009-2011, som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka civila samh&#xe4;llen inom milj&#xf6; och klimat omr&#xe5;det. Programmet &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven indelat i flera     olika delprogram var av ett som riktar sig till &#xd6;steuropeiska l&#xe4;nder  finns under insats: 54030088 och en f&#xf6;r kommunikation under           insat:54030087.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prolongation of a three year Framework Agreement for 2009-2011, with  main focus of on strengthening of civil society in the area of        environment and climate issues. The Programme is divided in several   sub-programmes such as climate, water, forestry etc. Their is also a  sub-program aimed at Eastern European countries that can be found     under 54030088 and for communication under 54030087</narrative>
  </description>
